{"id":"8747011468390705","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-truth-value-gap.md","title":"部分解释中的间隙及固定点编码刻画","display":"df-truth-value-gap — 部分解释中的间隙及固定点编码刻画","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-truth-value-gap","aliases":["91-df-truth-value-gap","91-df-gap"],"display":"df-truth-value-gap — 部分解释中的间隙及固定点编码刻画","depends_on":["[[91-df-three-valued-satisfaction]]","[[91-df-truth-value-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-truth-value-gap"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-truth-value-gap</span><span>91-df-gap</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-truth-value-gap — 部分解释中的间隙及固定点编码刻画"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2a6ae68f45ba9960\" href=\"?note=2a6ae68f45ba9960\" title=\"91-df-three-valued-satisfaction\">91-df-three-valued-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2bc1263010e83604\" href=\"?note=2bc1263010e83604\" title=\"91-df-truth-value-function\">91-df-truth-value-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma=(\\Gamma^+,\\Gamma^-)\">\\(\\Gamma=(\\Gamma^+,\\Gamma^-)\\)</span> 为 disjoint 的标准部分真理解释；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak N_\\Gamma=(\\mathbb N,\\Gamma^+,\\Gamma^-)\">\\(\\mathfrak N_\\Gamma=(\\mathbb N,\\Gamma^+,\\Gamma^-)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_\\Gamma\">\\(v_\\Gamma\\)</span> 为递归强 Kleene 评估。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 如为一致固定点，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma=(X,X^-)\">\\(\\Gamma=(X,X^-)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Gap}_{\\mathbb N,\\Gamma}\">\\(\\mathrm{Gap}_{\\mathbb N,\\Gamma}\\)</span> 为下述句子集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Gap}_X(\\varphi)\">\\(\\mathrm{Gap}_X(\\varphi)\\)</span> 为固定点间隙谓词。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}value\\text{-}gap}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{Gap}_{\\mathbb N,\\Gamma}\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}:v_\\Gamma(\\varphi)=\\mathbf u\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}value\\text{-}gap}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{Gap}_{\\mathbb N,\\Gamma}\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}:v_\\Gamma(\\varphi)=\\mathbf u\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Gap}_X(\\varphi)\\coloneqq v_X(\\varphi)=\\mathbf u\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\notin X\\land\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner\\notin X.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Gap}_X(\\varphi)\\coloneqq v_X(\\varphi)=\\mathbf u\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\notin X\\land\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner\\notin X.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>部分模型使用扩张与反扩张两个集合，不能把单个未闭合真集合当作已经定义了全部反信息。第二行的代码等价只在已假设的固定点上使用。\n直接闭项说谎者在每个一致固定点有间隙；真理陈述者在极小固定点有间隙而可在其他固定点确定。一般 PA 对角双条件及旧误称的“加强说谎者”不能在没有语法实现时直接赋未定义。</p>\n<p>来源：Definitions 15.10–15.11、Lemmas 15.12–15.14，印刷页 192–196。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-three-valued-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"2a6ae68f45ba9960","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 